  "source_pdf": "downloads/ao-bings-little-boat-v1.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "4c0abe1722411e4cc3187183297aa65789836d9296b5d6b847dabd730caa8b19",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c7e0fca2fe7f0a52e9734d9d00eb6339fed7f85d90c19666bba214a5e50a291a",
      "text": "Ao Bing’s\nLittle Boat",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f62f991e6af7d0c0e5c30a1292712a51233fcf080c63cd252eec83842e963091",
      "text": "Wukong and Ao Bing find a\nlittle leaf.\n“This leaf wants a boat ride!”\nSandy fills a tub with water.\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f451350bc6ef18b2681863c5dd9d92014854a78a5a3900ac9324502dc8809352",
      "text": "Wukong rolls a ball of clay.\n“Here is your boat,\nlittle leaf!”\nHe puts it in the water.\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "88f8e1bfe08faa577bb1fcd8cb6f945acce071e5226cc98a38d2802bc229a624",
      "text": "Plop!\nThe clay ball sinks\nall the way to the bottom.\nThe leaf is still waiting.\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "11d421928f0e31b70684aa6e276aeea4bd465287bcfe6494536b49a90c275de2",
      "text": "“Ao Bing, can dragon magic\nmake it float?”\nAo Bing smiles.\n“Let’s try with our hands.”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9a2aa052f49e8b84e76ca7ec37e9428ecc4d466fbb897807ff13fcefc5dc53ad",
      "text": "Wukong lifts the clay out.\n“It is the same clay,” says\nAo Bing.\n“Let’s change its shape.”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7eccca3d6935b34c825801609538b722c29e3560b00348b8899fb00932c870b4",
      "text": "They press it flat and wide.\n“A pancake boat!”\nsays Wukong.\n“Let’s test it!”\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "aeff5de9c566ca5c3d52c8d1f7ddf695ac86be8d8468d49857789179634febba",
      "text": "The flat clay sinks too,\nslowly, slowly, down.\n“Hmm,” says Ao Bing.\n“It needs edges.”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b7ea3b818f4edd664b2a562a7eeaf5305befb8e5c741695d5c0d4a662c6a49b0",
      "text": "They change the shape again.\nThey pinch up the edges,\nall the way around.\nNow the middle is hollow.\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ab5117f4d93a67f976bbfd88cf11fed4a258f77947ffc3d7c387bc881a7fa54d",
      "text": "They test it again.\nThe clay boat floats!\n“It floats!” shouts Wukong.\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b38b5f9d92d28cecddd32573d076c8902cbcefa29b040da0e0f3b3df34a81f42",
      "text": "“Same clay,” says Ao Bing,\n“but a hollow shape.”\nSandy smiles. “Good test!”\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ef0434eb2547903cd74ab63381c51e9e647cb242307d3e63cc86c20adaeaa676",
      "text": "Wukong sets the leaf in\nthe boat.\nThe edges keep the\nwater out.\nThe leaf rides on top!\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "47e3769cde9955b2056ed8eec905ef238c399614e91b58995aac35bc4fb8180f",
      "text": "Wukong looks up at the\npeach tree.\n“I will call it the Big Peach!”\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "69429f91d2dede1b54756510f3348d709b08713bc864b0196ef27cc1b2ea481b",
      "text": "Ao Bing laughs.\n“A big name is fine.\nBut no big peach on board!”\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "727af556db01ada0b4b1f820b4247afac11f7b1152bafac638859797931af25a",
      "text": "Wukong blows softly.\nWhoosh!\nThe Big Peach sails across\nthe tub.\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fb728ee5115b311c71e61a4c16b3df078426a1d9a133904a4d09365031c9d4de",
      "text": "Sandy brings a real peach.\n“This one is for us,” he says,\n“not for the boat!”\nThe little leaf sails on.\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
